<page-top />
<view class="page insights-page">
  <view class="report-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">THE LITTLE FAMILY JOURNAL</text><view class="title">把照顾，装订成册</view><view class="subtitle">每一件认真做过的小事，都有回声。</view></view><view class="report-seal"><bunny-mark small/><text>家人接力</text></view></view>
  <view class="report-tabs"><view class="chip {{tab==='week'?'active':''}}" data-tab="week" bindtap="tabChange" hover-class="press" aria-role="button" aria-label="查看照顾周记">照顾周记</view><view class="chip {{tab==='handover'?'active':''}}" data-tab="handover" bindtap="tabChange" hover-class="press" aria-role="button" aria-label="查看交接卡">交接卡</view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{tab==='week' && report}}">
    <view class="week-ticket"><view class="ticket-top"><view class="week-arrow" data-delta="-1" bindtap="weekChange" hover-class="press" aria-role="button" aria-label="上一周">‹</view><view><text class="eyebrow">我们的照顾周记</text><view class="week-range">{{report.label}}</view></view><view class="week-arrow {{!report.canNext?'disabled':''}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="weekChange" hover-class="press" aria-role="button" aria-label="下一周" aria-disabled="{{!report.canNext}}">›</view></view><view class="ticket-score"><text>{{report.count}}</text><text> / {{report.total}} 项日常照顾</text><view class="week-return" bindtap="currentWeek" aria-role="button">回本周 ↗</view></view><view class="progress-track"><view style="width:{{report.progress}}%"></view></view><view class="ticket-caption">按已过去的 {{report.elapsed}} 天统计 · 未来的日子不提前计分</view><view class="ticket-stats"><view><text>{{report.planDone}}</text><text>计划完成</text></view><view bindtap="goDiary" aria-role="button"><text>{{report.noteCount}}</text><text>篇心情旁白 ↗</text></view><view><text>{{report.photoCount}}</text><text>张有日期的照片</text></view></view></view>
    <view class="week-pet" wx:for="{{report.pets}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="week-identity" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pet" aria-role="button" aria-label="查看{{item.name}}档案"><image src="{{item.photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="pet-name">{{item.name}}的小周记 ↗</text><view class="muted">{{item.completeDays}} 天集齐四项照顾</view></view></view><text class="week-count">{{item.count}}/{{item.total}}</text></view><view class="week-marks"><view wx:for="{{item.marks}}" wx:for-item="day" wx:key="date" class="week-mark {{day.future?'future':''}}"><text>周{{day.label}}</text><view class="mark-count mark-{{day.count}}">{{day.future?'·':day.count+'/4'}}</view><text>{{day.number}}日</text></view></view><view class="weight-note">{{item.weightText}}</view><view class="tiny" wx:if="{{item.weightHint}}">{{item.weightHint}}</view></view>
    <view class="week-memory" wx:if="{{report.memories.length}}"><view class="card-head"><text class="card-title">这一周的片尾彩蛋</text><text class="card-hint">只收录已填写日期的照片</text></view><view class="report-frames"><image wx:for="{{report.memories}}" wx:key="id" src="{{item.src}}" mode="aspectFill" data-src="{{item.src}}" bindtap="previewPhoto" aria-label="预览{{item.title}}"/></view></view>
    <view class="empty report-empty" wx:if="{{!report.count && !report.planDone && !report.noteCount && !report.photoCount}}"><bunny-mark small/><view>这一周，等你留下一点可爱。</view><text>照顾、写日记或给照片填上日期，周记就会慢慢长出来。</text></view>
    <view class="button mint" bindtap="goCare" hover-class="press" aria-role="button">去照顾日程，做一件小事 ↗</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{tab==='handover' && card}}">
    <view class="handover-intro"><view class="envelope-corner"></view><text class="eyebrow">TO THE NEXT CARETAKER</text><view class="card-title">你不在家的时候，照顾也能接上。</view><view class="muted">今天的照顾、未来三天日程和特别说明，夹进同一封信。</view><view class="row"><text class="tiny">更新于 {{today}} · 本机记录</text><view class="text-btn" bindtap="edit" aria-role="button">填写说明 ✎</view></view></view>
    <view class="handover-pet" wx:for="{{card.pets}}" wx:key="id"><image src="{{item.photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="handover-pet-body"><text class="pet-name">{{item.name}}</text><view class="handover-checks"><text wx:for="{{item.marks}}" wx:for-item="mark" wx:key="label" class="handover-mark {{mark.done?'done':''}}">{{mark.done?'✓':'○'}} {{mark.label}}</text></view><view class="care-instruction">{{item.note || '还没有特别照顾说明，点“填写说明”补充。'}}</view></view></view>
    <view class="paper-card"><view class="card-head"><text class="card-title">未来三天 · 待照顾</text><view class="text-btn" bindtap="goCare" aria-role="button">去安排 ↗</view></view><view class="cell" wx:for="{{card.plans}}" wx:key="id"><view class="cell-body"><text class="cell-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="cell-label">{{item.day}} {{item.time}} · {{item.pets}}</text><text class="plan-note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</text></view><text class="cell-value">{{item.assignee}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!card.plans.length}}" class="muted">没有待办计划，可以先安排一次换垫料或称重。</view></view>
    <view class="paper-card alert-paper" wx:if="{{card.reminders.length || card.low.length}}"><text class="card-title">交接时，多叮嘱一句</text><view class="cell" wx:for="{{card.reminders}}" wx:key="id"><text class="cell-title">{{item.pet}} · {{item.title}}</text><text class="cell-value">{{item.due}}</text></view><view class="cell" wx:for="{{card.low}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="goSupplies" aria-role="button"><view class="cell-body"><text class="cell-title">{{item.name}}需要补给</text><text class="cell-label">现余 {{item.quantity}} {{item.unit}}，到补给页登记 ↗</text></view></view></view>
    <view class="contact-paper" bindtap="edit" hover-class="press" aria-role="button" aria-label="编辑交接留言和联系方式"><text class="card-title">家人留言</text><view>{{card.info.note || '钥匙放在哪、喜欢怎样被抱……把小习惯也留给家人。'}}</view><text wx:if="{{card.info.contactName || card.info.contactPhone}}">联系家人 · {{card.info.contactName}} {{card.info.contactPhone}}</text><text wx:if="{{card.info.clinic || card.info.clinicPhone}}">常去医院 · {{card.info.clinic}} {{card.info.clinicPhone}}</text><text class="tiny">点这里修改 · 只显示你亲自填写的信息</text></view>
    <view class="export-actions"><view class="button mint" bindtap="copy" hover-class="press" aria-role="button">复制完整文字</view><view class="button pink" bindtap="exportCard" hover-class="press" aria-role="button" aria-label="生成照顾交接图片">{{exporting?'正在装进信封…':'生成图片信笺'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{exportPath}}" class="text-btn" bindtap="saveCard" aria-role="button">把刚生成的交接卡保存到手机相册 ↓</view><view class="tiny export-note">图片为精简快照，长说明请复制完整文字。分享后状态不会自动同步。</view>
  </block>
</view>
<canvas id="handover-canvas" type="2d" class="export-canvas"></canvas>
<bunny-menu />
<view class="drawer-mask" wx:if="{{editing}}" bindtap="close"><view class="drawer" style="padding-top:{{safeTop}}px" catchtap="stop"><view class="drawer-head"><text>给接力家人的小信 ♡</text><view class="close" bindtap="close" aria-role="button" aria-label="关闭交接说明">×</view></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="drawer-body"><view class="muted">以下都可以留空。照顾要求由你填写，不自动生成医疗建议。</view><view class="field" wx:for="{{petFields}}" wx:key="id"><text class="field-label">{{item.name}}的照顾说明</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{item.value}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindinput="petField" maxlength="600" placeholder="吃什么、喜欢什么、需要注意什么…" aria-label="{{item.name}}照顾说明"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">交接留言</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="field" maxlength="600" placeholder="想叮嘱家人的话…" aria-label="交接留言"/></view><view class="form-grid"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">紧急联系家人</text><input class="input" value="{{form.contactName}}" data-field="contactName" bindinput="field" maxlength="30" placeholder="姓名（选填）" aria-label="紧急联系人姓名"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">联系电话</text><input class="input" type="text" value="{{form.contactPhone}}" data-field="contactPhone" bindinput="field" maxlength="40" placeholder="电话（选填）" aria-label="紧急联系人电话"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">常去的宠物医院</text><input class="input" value="{{form.clinic}}" data-field="clinic" bindinput="field" maxlength="60" placeholder="医院名称（选填）" aria-label="医院名称"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">医院联系电话</text><input class="input" value="{{form.clinicPhone}}" data-field="clinicPhone" bindinput="field" maxlength="40" placeholder="电话（选填）" aria-label="医院联系电话"/></view><view class="feedback" wx:if="{{feedback}}">{{feedback}}</view><view class="save-btn pink" bindtap="save" hover-class="press" aria-role="button">夹进照顾交接卡 ♡</view></scroll-view></view></view>
